      "created_at": "2019-01-24T01:45:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So the two campaigns breifly went through Char Creation but I'm a bit concerned about Abilities. They never really glossed over them in the two campaigns and from reading the 11 pregens some of them feel unique to the hero and some feel unique to the archetypes you got during creation. But I read the core book to Mutants and Masterminds and my god is it complicated ability creation is so free form it gives me a headache trying to make a char... Will Sentinels be a bit less complicated for those who already have a concept? (Mine being a heroic necromancer and a Japanese Style Superhero)&nbsp;</p>",
