      "created_at": "2019-01-24T02:47:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mutants and Masterminds (and Champions/HERO System) are both notorious for their labyrinthine character generation rules.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I haven't seen anything beyond the livestreams, but I'd be quite surprised if the SCRPG was anywhere close to those.&nbsp; I'm guessing it'll be closer to creation for a FATE character or a Savage Worlds character.&nbsp;</p>",
