    {
      "id": 225208,
      "name": "Phantom5613",
      "username": "Phantom5613",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-01-29T15:22:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PlatinumWarlock\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/48/1869_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> PlatinumWarlock:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m guessing it’ll be closer to creation for a FATE character or a Savage Worlds character.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Anubis\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anubis/48/4949_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Anubis:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I know DnD and World of Darkness&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As an avid player and GM of many varied game systems and having watched&nbsp; Christopher and Paul’s streams, I’m confident to say that I think character creation will be on the easier end of the spectrum. Probably a little more involved than Savage Worlds(Which really isn’t difficult at all if you know what kind of character you want to play) but not as difficult as WoD(Which most books come with a cheat-sheet for character creation).</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:47.611Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 2,
      "readers_count": 1,
      "score": 0.4,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 18890,
      "topic_slug": "character-creation-concerns",
      "display_username": "Phantom5613",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
