      "created_at": "2019-01-31T12:17:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Some people like to have a little randomness, either to inject a dose of the unexpected or just to help them decide. That’s clearly not your thing, and that’s fine too - knowing that people have strong feelings one way or the other might be why they’ve included both options.</p>",
