      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-01-31T18:32:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The specific dice they used was determined at each step.&nbsp; There didn't seem to be any rhyme or reason to it, but everyone was rolling different combinations of dice depending on what they'd chosen in previous steps.&nbsp; It was two dice, and you could pick the result of either die or the sum of them.&nbsp; Again, I don't know if it's changed since then.</p>",
